 "description": "For a shared mission, require fleet_id, artifact_id, read_receipt_id and matching artifact_sha256. Accept or reject, then report reuse and completion with evidence. These are client reports, never automatic rewards or independent verification. Private legacy proof review remains a separate contract.",
 "execution": null,
 "icons": null,
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
